<body lang=TR link="#0563C1" vlink=purple>

<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center;line-height:150%'><b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>DEVLET
MEMURLARI KANUNU İLE BAZI KANUNLARDA VE 375 SAYILI KANUN HÜKMÜNDE KARARNAMEDE
DEĞİŞİKLİK YAPILMASINA DAİR KANUN</span></b></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0
 style='margin-left:12.5pt;border-collapse:collapse'>
 <tr>
  <td width=211 valign=top style='width:158.25pt;padding:0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  3.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><b><u><span
  style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Kanun No. <span
  style='color:black'>7417</span></span></u></b></p>
  </td>
  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.85pt;padding:0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
  margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center;text-indent:17.0pt;
  line-height:normal'><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>&nbsp;</span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td width=256 valign=top style='width:192.0pt;padding:0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
  margin-bottom:3.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center;text-indent:17.0pt;
  line-height:normal'><b><span style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'> <u>Kabul
  Tarihi: 1/7/2022      </u></span></b></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:17.0pt;line-height:normal'><b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:#00B050'>&nbsp;</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:17.0pt;line-height:normal'><b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>MADDE 1-</span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'> 9/6/1930 tarihli
ve 1700 sayılı Dahiliye Memurları Kanununun ek 5 inci maddesi aşağıdaki şekilde
değiştirilmiştir.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:17.0pt;line-height:normal'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>“EK MADDE 5- Mülki
İdare Amirliği Hizmetleri Sınıfı kadrolarında bulunan personelin 375 sayılı
Kanun Hükmünde Kararnameye ekli (I) sayılı Cetvele göre yararlanmakta oldukları
ek ödemeleri aşağıdaki oranların eklenmesi suretiyle uygulanır.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:17.0pt;line-height:normal'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0
 style='margin-left:4.0pt;border-collapse:collapse'>
 <tr style='height:3.0pt'>
  <td width=481 valign=top style='width:360.8pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;
  padding:4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt;height:3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-indent:8.5pt'><b><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>KADRO
  VE GÖREV UNVANI</span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td width=114 style='width:85.35pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;border-left:none;
  padding:4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt;height:3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>ORAN
  (%)</span></b></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='height:3.0pt'>
  <td width=481 valign=top style='width:360.8pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;padding:4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt;height:3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-indent:8.5pt'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Merkezde
  görevli diğer Valiler</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;
  padding:4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt;height:3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center;text-indent:17.0pt'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>168</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='height:3.0pt'>
  <td width=481 valign=top style='width:360.8pt;border:solid black 1.0pt;
  border-top:none;padding:4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt;height:3.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-indent:8.5pt'><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Kurul
  Başkanı, Genel Müdür, Strateji Geliştirme Başkanı ile bu görevleri yürüten merkezde
  görevli Valiler</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;
